# CRM UX system

See `docs/ux/CRM-UX-SYSTEM.md` for the full roadmap. Prefer shared kits under `src/modules/shared/` over one-off UI.

## Open protocol

- Always use helpers in `src/app/routing.ts` (`getPersonShowPath`, `getClientShowPath`, …).
- Hubs: Preview sheet or selection panel. Deep work: Full view. Side panels: Context card + link.
- Do not hardcode stale paths like `/companies/:id/show` when a helper exists.

## Dialog vs Sheet

- **Dialog** — short create/edit forms (`CreateFormDialogShell`, `ContactFormDialog`, …).
- **Sheet** — browse / detail / preview overlays.
- Do not add a second create surface for the same entity (prefer one form shell).

## Hub selection

List + selection URL + Preview/panel; on mobile prefer full page. Converge Accounts / Tickets / Messages toward the same mental model; Deals may stay full-page if documented.

## Chrome

- Prefer shared empty / loading / back primitives when they exist under `src/modules/shared/chrome/`.
- Right-rail collapse: use `CollapsibleRelatedPanel` (or future `CollapsibleRail`) with **right**-side affordances (`PanelRightOpen`), not left-drawer icons.
- Buttons: `docs/ux/BUTTON-SYSTEM.md` — use `Button` / `IconButton`; Create CTAs use `Plus`; do not hand-roll CTA chrome.

## Atoms (when present)

- `EntityQuickActions` for Call / Email / SMS / More — do not copy CircleButton stacks per module.
- `StatusPill` + domain maps for stages/statuses — do not dump raw `status.replace(/_/g, " ")`.

## Language

CRM product chrome is English. Portal / proposal document i18n may stay bilingual.
